# Edition output — generated, not committed

This is the Vael Paper *generator* repo. Editions are output: the nightly run
writes them here (or into the vael-paper repo's editions/), and the server
reads whichever folder it is pointed at. Do not commit generated editions.
The paper's identity — editions/paper.json — is the one file in here that is
real and should be kept.

# Local state
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The generated edition folders
/editions/2026-*/
/editions/ci/

# Chart plates the exporter draws from the chart: blocks
/samples/edition/*/images/
/site/
/build/

# What quickstart.sh fetches and builds — delete it to start over
/.quickstart/

# Test and tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/.engine/
.venv/
.claude/
inbox/feeds.md
site/
